Monaspace Neon 1.400. Family name in the Font list: "Monaspace Neon".

Unmodified copies of the upstream static fonts (OpenType/CFF). The variable
build is named "Monaspace Neon Var" and has no italic file, so the static
build is the one that carries the plain family name and real italics.

- `MonaspaceNeon-Regular.otf`, `-Bold.otf`, `-Italic.otf`, `-BoldItalic.otf`:
  `Static Fonts/Monaspace Neon/` of the GitHub release v1.400,
  https://github.com/githubnext/monaspace/releases/tag/v1.400
  (monaspace-static-v1.400.zip, sha256
  ab66d71be751495f679727332a3345597943bd4d7beebca03f5cde04bf994de7)
  sha256 0daf2cd6cbd780b1a9426cb25c17e80f22844051f988a5133ad54b2751b0b8af (Regular),
  9ff6e131e139c73fe67d1cc045a8a536078fa56cd2c69ee33f0475238a8a9609 (Bold),
  8bf31d46a42df399444d2a5a16095cc706cbf20bc6637af4a251b5958b02cdbc (Italic),
  6a6bc24aefa327ec73991ca4f93d764cfc19209a3f34252fa6c2ffb5da41a4e8 (BoldItalic).
